##
 * vir-lsp/src/main.vri — Vir Native Language Server Protocol Daemon
 * Version: 1.3.0 (Pure Vir Native Binary)
 *
 * Implements the LSP 3.17 daemon for the Vir language:
 * - Content-Length JSON-RPC 2.0 transport over stdio
 * - Full capability negotiation (schemaVersion 1, semanticTokenModifiers)
 * - In-process AST & Semantic Analysis engine
 * - Document sync (didOpen, didChange, didClose)
 * - Hover with markdown documentation & type signatures
 * - Go to Definition & Find References graph
 * - Completion with keywords, built-ins & scope symbols
 * - Safe Symbol Rename with collision & keyword rejection
 * - Delta-encoded Semantic Tokens with Vir modifier bitmasks
 * - vir/semanticSnapshot & vir/diagnosticSnapshot custom extensions
 * - Real-time textDocument/publishDiagnostics notifications
 ##

